tered in Bengaluru, India.","employees":24240,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795529493},"analyst":{"key":"buy","mean":1.66667,"n":9,"tMean":821.1111,"tHigh":900,"tLow":760,"tMed":820,"currency":"INR","asOf":1795529493,"trend":{"strongBuy":2,"buy":5,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}},"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795529492,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Manipal Health Enterprises\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Credent Connect N Care Ltd (CREDENT) Share Price","s":"Business Today","d":1795512760,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxOOUFIZkpEeGFRdEx0ckZxTUxRVTZyeGhqSjJBUW5kekpVeFh4SWlyVlJNNFdJUVBuUzdPcE9ydndtWW01bVJrYUVxSU5jT20teEhydzVXVVB3MnJaWGU2UHg5Q1VUaGZ4R200YVV0ZFhpR1VSTHJtSFBMbEFhOG5hVEhUcmZGWWtWWmNJcUVWYi10REU?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Manipal Health Enterprises Ltd. Share Price Live Today","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1795427940,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQUHozdERRQ1BMeGIxUUFzQktzRGlURHlGMFNEQlN5aFFSUXVSM1BoZlRVOElsRG9WcEZjMmhoNDhaZm9jTnVDRWp6NUROTzVkQnpvWTFNQ0twZlItR1VtRlozRkl1OHctMUZWTXlOLXVianVhZHp5Y0R0c0tTQjRQblBJbEhsTzNsNzVRSm9wYmlfQnc?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Manipal Health Enterprises releases Q1FY27 earnings call transcript","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795333427,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOUWl2Wms5UjV2ZTZTZzRWY0ZpUC1jbVhwcHd3WWRTRFJnWm5PT05RWUJKeGNybTZjZEphS25QV0F4X1k0SmtpekRyaTdFSVlyTlJObWJRUlpvVFdVTFg0ZTItZENLMG9reHFGZHFnSmpKNkN1dGluZzFNdElvelRWeXgyM1Myc1pVWUx0a3I0NzJlWVcyS2xnaF9WYmxTT0ZQSUJ2MlJaSTh5TENCdkN6bTI0dFBEOHFCalE?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Manipal Health Enterprises Limited (MANIPALHOS.BO) company profile and facts","s":"Yahoo Finance Australia","d":1795272996,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE1ZaFBSeUJQc2NmbjBCcU5jMzBMZFJ3dnBpX1BtclhFc1pBNXVITlBYWmtSeTRSTm03Tk53ZW9kS0dZcnpwLTJPTnFzVzUyM0NDTFZKOUduVXp5eTlDVWhsNGdEeVg5UllR?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Manipal Acquires Kinder Hospital for ₹130 Crore",